## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `VaultDoorTraining.java` using `wget`.
2. Open the java file and see the function `check_password_function`.
3. Flag will be there and add with `academy{}` and paste it in challenge field.



